{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "48fbe73d-7149-8dff-ac2a-356c0fd62db0",
  "created_at": "2026-02-04T16:03:57-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Kathleen Dolan",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T16:01:28-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T16:01:30-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Denise. My name is Kathleen Dolan, and I'm calling about the storm drain in front of my building. It's 28 Washington Street, down the Point."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T16:01:39-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 28 Washington. What's it doing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T16:01:42-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Nothing, that's the problem. It's not draining. The catch basin is packed with sand, from the winter road stuff, the salt and sand mix, and the street has been holding water since the weekend. And it's not even raining. It's been dry for days."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T16:01:57-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So it's just sitting there, standing water."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T16:02:00-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, a big puddle that goes across the whole lane and up on the sidewalk. People are walking in the road to get around it. I went out yesterday and pulled the leaves off the grate by hand, and I'll be honest, it drained for about ten minutes and then it just stopped again. Because it's the sand underneath. You can see it through the bars."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T16:02:21-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that'll do it. Leaves are one thing, but if the basin itself is full, the grate won't help."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T16:02:28-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Exactly. And this isn't the first time something's been let go on this street. It used to be, back when the old market was on the corner, um, well, that's a pharmacy now, anyway, somebody came around and cleaned these out. Nobody does anymore."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T16:02:42-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. Let me get this down. 28 Washington Street, catch basin full of sand, standing water since Saturday or Sunday?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T16:02:50-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Saturday night, I'd say. It was there Sunday morning for sure."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T16:02:54-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And do you want a call back when it's scheduled? What's the best number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T16:03:00-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 401-555-0192. That's my home phone, same number since 1989, so you can't miss me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T16:03:06-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good, that's easy. I'm entering it now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T16:03:09-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So will there be a work order opened? And for what date? Because I'd like an actual date, not just somebody saying they'll get to it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T16:03:18-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I'm opening the work order right now, so you'll have it on file as of today, Wednesday the fourth. The crew that does the basins sets the actual day, and I don't see the schedule from here. I'll flag it as standing water so it doesn't sit at the bottom of the pile. Realistically you're looking at later this week or early next."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T16:03:39-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Later this week or early next. I'm going to hold you to that, nicely."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T16:03:45-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fair. If you don't hear from us by Monday, call back and give me the work order number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T16:03:52-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, thank you, Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T16:03:54-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Stay out of that puddle."
    }
  ],
